<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιδέα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ας</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything that binds</i> or <i>is bound around,
			bracelet</i> or <i>anklet,</i> mostly pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.69
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				320.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.652<i>A</i>18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				660.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristaenet.
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				31.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>iron rings,</i> by which folding-doors were secured in hinges,
				<i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.834b
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				ii99
			</span></i>: sg. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).147.7
				</span></i>
			 (Delos, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀμφίδεα,</span>
			<i>rim</i> of the <i>os uteri,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.57
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.78
			</span></i>:—sg.</div>
